{"id":"97b46a497e251f9f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-closure-operators.md","title":"Closure Operators","display":"df-closure-operators — Closure Operators","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-closure-operators","aliases":["93-df-closure-operators"],"display":"df-closure-operators — Closure Operators","depends_on":["[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-closure-operators"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-closure-operators</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closure-operators — Closure Operators"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{K}\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{K}\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{I}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{H}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{P}_{U,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{I}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{H}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau},\\mathrm{P}_{U,\\tau}\\)</span> are the type-indexed class operators defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> is the homomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> is the isomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\)</span> is the subalgebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)\\)</span> is the product constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(-,-;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(-,-;I,\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}\\)</span> are the constructor and predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}\\)</span> are the composite closure operators defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{I}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\exists\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{I}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\exists\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{H}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\exists\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{H}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\exists\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\exists\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\exists\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K^I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K^I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{P}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K^I\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{P}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau):\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K^I\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{H}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{H}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{I}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{P}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operators}\\vdash\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{I}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{S}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{P}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{P}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Surjectivity is expanded as equality of the image and target carrier. Isomorphic-copy and ultraproduct closure are separated from homomorphic images, so Birkhoff and quasivariety generation have distinct exact operators.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","e